stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INIT : POST /agent/chat or /upload or /manual

    INIT --> CLASSIFYING : orchestrator starts

    CLASSIFYING --> PARSING : mode is CHAT or DOC
    CLASSIFYING --> SCHEMA_GENERATING : mode is MANUAL skip LLM parsing

    PARSING --> SCHEMA_GENERATING : extracted_schema saved

    SCHEMA_GENERATING --> CONFIDENCE_SCORING : draft_api saved GPT-4o call 1

    CONFIDENCE_SCORING --> HITL_PENDING : confidence_map saved GPT-4o call 2

    HITL_PENDING --> VALIDATING : POST hitl or confirm human edits submitted

    VALIDATING --> HITL_PENDING : validation_errors found user must fix
    VALIDATING --> API_TESTING : all checks passed

    API_TESTING --> SAVING : test verdicts recorded non-blocking

    SAVING --> SAVED : ApiDefinition created

    CLASSIFYING --> FAILED : exception
    PARSING --> FAILED : exception
    SCHEMA_GENERATING --> FAILED : LLM error or rate limit
    CONFIDENCE_SCORING --> FAILED : LLM error
    VALIDATING --> FAILED : unrecoverable error
    API_TESTING --> FAILED : unrecoverable error
    SAVING --> FAILED : DB error

    SAVED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
